  "Overview": "The objective of Resistor is to build connections to carry flow to activate electrical components. To avoid damaging these components, the flow level must be reduced using resistors.\n\nEach level is graded upon number of pieces used, the luminosity of the components, and the time required to complete the level.\n\nThis game teaches the basics of resistor color code values.",
